      <title>Fortinet FortiManager FortiJump Unauthenticated RCE (CVE-2024-47575)</title>
      <link>http://100.89.152.30:1313/pocs/network/2026-05-17_fortimanager-fortijump-rce-cve-2024-47575/</link>
